# Copy this file to .env.r2 and fill in the real values, then run:
#   python scripts/pull_r2.py
# to pull a read-only snapshot of production (data/, tournaments/,
# static/images/photos/, static/images/podium/) into your local folders.
#
# This file is loaded only by scripts/pull_r2.py, never by the main app
# (config.py only loads .env) - so it's safe to leave filled in between runs
# without any risk of the app uploading local changes back to production.
#
# Get the values from the Render dashboard: hhb-club service -> Environment
# tab -> reveal R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID / R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY / R2_BUCKET /
# R2_ENDPOINT_URL. (Or the Cloudflare dashboard under R2 -> Manage API
# Tokens / bucket overview, if you don't have Render access.)
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
R2_BUCKET=
R2_ENDPOINT_URL=https://<accountid>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com
